msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - For higher-performance simulation that can handle larger circuits, or to incorporate noise models into your simulation, see [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"  - To learn how to use Quantum Composer for simulation, see the [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer) guide.\n"
"  - Read the [Qiskit Estimator API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator) reference.\n"
"  - Read the [Qiskit Sampler API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler) reference.\n"
"  - Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"  - Per una simulazione con prestazioni superiori, in grado di gestire circuiti più grandi o di incorporare modelli di rumore, consulta [Simulazione esatta e con rumore con le primitive di Qiskit Aer](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"  - Per imparare a usare Quantum Composer per la simulazione, consulta la guida [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer).\n"
"  - Leggi il riferimento [Qiskit Estimator API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator).\n"
"  - Leggi il riferimento [Qiskit Sampler API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler).\n"
"  - Leggi [Migra alle primitive V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
